stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ONLINE: POST /api/v1/platforms<br/>(status='ONLINE')
    ONLINE --> ONLINE: PUT — INSERT new row<br/>same id, updated fields
    ONLINE --> DELETED: DELETE — INSERT new row<br/>status='DELETED'
    DELETED --> ONLINE: POST again — INSERT<br/>new row, status='ONLINE'

    note right of ONLINE
        Latest row: status=ONLINE
        --
        Can register identifiers
        (POST /v1/identifiers).
        Lookup returns this row.
        Users auth via mTLS.
        Dataset GETs route here
        (platform.base_url).
        Platform performs subsetting
        per regulation requirement.
    end note

    note right of DELETED
        Latest row: status=DELETED
        --
        Excluded from list queries
        (filter status != 'DELETED').
        Platform mTLS auth fails.
        Consignments rows stay;
        non-latest rows archived
        nightly by CronManager.
        Row retained for audit.
    end note
